window.products.push({"id":124016,"name":"285805 Water Inlet Valve Whirlpool Kenmore Washer AP3094541 PS334646 Maytag Washing Machine Part Replacement 110.26912690 LSR7233EQ0 TAWS700RQ3 LSR843","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hqMHC5fmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💡 Washer Inlet Valve 285805 - An equivalent for parts AP3094541, 285805VP, 292197, 3349451, 3354565, 3360387, 3360388, 358992, 370067, 388328, 868761, 99989697, AH334646, EA334646, PS334646, W10110517. Ultra Durable 285805 Inlet Valve is compatible with Whirlpool, Crosley, Estate, Inglis, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Roper. The valve is made from durable materials and is designed to withstand the high water pressure and temperature changes that occur during the wash cycle. It fits hundreds of models. 🔧 DIY eTips Included - Not sure how to replace the Inlet Valve 285805? Helpful information can be found on the page below. Scroll down to get more repair tips. Acquire valuable skills during the DIY repair project. Kenmore Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve 285805 will help if your appliance does not stop filling with water, there's no hot or cold water, or it's leaking. It is important to ensure that the power and water supply to the washing machine are turned off before beginning installation. 💡 Whirlpool 285805 is designed to control the flow of water into the washer during the wash cycle. The valve is responsible for opening and closing the water supply to the machine and ensuring the proper amount of water is dispensed. Installation of the 285805 Water Inlet Valve is a straightforward and can be easily done with basic plumbing knowledge. 285805 Washer Water Inlet Valve meets or exceeds all manufacturer specifications. We provide a lifetime warranty and guarantee 100% money back. 💡 Are washer inlet valves universal? Washer inlet valves are not universal and can vary depending on the brand and model of the washer. While some models may use the same type of inlet valve, others may require a specific type or size. It's important to check the manufacturer's specifications and the washing machine's model number to ensure that you purchase the correct inlet valve for your washer. Using an incorrect or incompatible valve can result in leaks or damage to your washing machine. 💡 Can you clean a water inlet valve? Yes, it is possible to clean a water inlet valve, although it depends on the cause of the problem. In some cases, the valve may be clogged with debris or mineral buildup, which can be removed by cleaning it with a soft brush and a solution of vinegar and water. However, if the valve is damaged or malfunctioning, it may need to be replaced entirely. If the valve is still not working correctly after the cleaning, it may be time to replace it with a new one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hqMHC5fmS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PartsBroz","source_asin":"B07V5X6JS5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-124016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V5X6JS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V5X6JS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
