window.products.push({"id":124079,"name":"Kalamera 24'' Beverage refrigerator Cooler, 120 Cans & 16 Bottles, Single Zone Built-in or Freestanding, with Seamless Stainless Steel & Triple-Layer ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qib1LFFIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LARGE STORAGE MINI BAR For CAN & WINE: This beer fridge just under 23”X24” of floor space, you get storage space for up to 120 cans & 16 bottles of your favorite cold beverages and wine! The beer cooler with white LED light, you could find out your favorite cool drink quickly. The top roller wooden shelf could hold your favorite wine (1-16 bottle), and your wine is in security with the roller. With our cooler, you won’t just own a beverage refrigerator, you’ll have a wine cooler too. SLEEK DESIGN: This small fridge with Seamless Stainless Steel and transparent glass front with white LED cooler light add elegant design and practical function to your home. This beverage mini refrigerator with single zone temperature control - easy to change the temperature to 38°F. It will become one of the highlight in your house. REMOVABLE WIRE & WOODEN RACKS: Four wire racks with one roller wooden shelf remove easily to quickly add cases of wine, beer or soda cans. You could take one of the shelf away from the drink maker when you need to put the higher can. The glass door is double layer which is reflecting the UV on the first glass before reaching the second glass. This fridges with reversible door and adjustable feet, so it is flexible for different home and kitchen. ADVANCED COMPRESSOR COOLING SYSTEM: Whisper-quiet compressor maintains even cool temperature longer, with fewer stops and starts! This beverage refrigerators mini cooler can cool your drink better than others and help you enjoy your drink. The mini fridge no freezer, with an automatic defrosting function, could help the bar fridge work well under the counter. As a free-standing, the beautiful design also help this drink refrigerator become a beautiful scenery line in our house. TEMPERATURE MEMORY FUNCTION: Restore the set temperature in the can cooler after it is back on from power lost, which keeps your drink cooler from going bad with increasing temperature.★Kalamera wine cooler & beverage refrigerator has been sold since 2014, we do what our customers need. Any further information needed before purchasing, you could contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qib1LFFIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kalamera","source_asin":"B01IF0BX70","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-124079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IF0BX70","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IF0BX70","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":124080,"name":"Whirlpool WTW8100BW Cabrio 4.5 Cu. Ft. White Top Load Washer - Energy Star","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FCI3vA+nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Whirlpool White Top Load Washer WTW8100BW. Wash 3 baskets of laundry in one load. The washer's 4.5 cu. ft. capacity wash basket offers enough space to handle larger loads and bulky items. Adaptive Wash technology with Auto Load Sensing automatically senses and adapts to the size of your load and uses the right amount of water for great cleaning. Up to 11 different adaptive wash actions provide a combination of powerful cleaning and gentle fabric care. They sense and adapt to the needs of each load, handling everything from heavily soiled jeans to delicates. Adjusts the cold and hot water inlets to reach temperatures that are warm enough to dissolve detergents. Water is kept from overheating to help reduce shrinking and/or color bleeding. The direct drive motor handles larger capacity loads, enhances the spin speed for improved energy savings and uses fewer moving parts so there's less wear and tear over time. Get additional energy efficiency without giving up cleaning performance. This option uses less hot water and increases the tumbling action to use less energy while still delivering great cleaning and gentle performance. The unique soft-touch impeller helps move clothes gently through the water allowing the H2Low wash system to provide better cleaning performance and gentle fabric care. Total Capacity: 4.5 cu. ft. Number of Cycles: 11. Max Spin Speed: 1,100 RPM. Number of Spin Speeds: 3. Number of Temperatures: 4. Adaptive Wash Actions: 11. Bleach Dispenser: Timed Bleach Dispenser. Extra Rinse: Yes. EcoBoost Option: Yes with Eco Monitor. Number of Soil Levels: 3. Water Level Sensor: Auto Load Size Sensing Technology. Direct Drive Motor: Yes. Estimated Time Remaining Display: Yes. Deep Water Soak Cycle: Yes. Automatic Water Level Settings: Yes. Designed, Engineered and Assembled in the US: Yes. Drum Material: Stainless Steel. Lid: See-Through Glass Window. Parts Warranty: 1 Year. Labor Warranty: 1 Year. Warranty Notes: See Written Warranty for Full Details. Produ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FCI3vA+nL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B00E48ZR5M","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-124080","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00E48ZR5M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00E48ZR5M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
