window.products.push({"id":124644,"name":"Manual Milk Frother Hand Pump，Stainless Steel Milk Creamer Frother with Lid，Handheld Coffee Milk Frothing Pitchers， Cappuccino Latte Coffee Foam Pitch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BUuPMoqSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No Electricity Needed, Great for Travel Since the pumping action is done entirely by hand, there's no need for an electrical outlet, and no complicated machinery to break down.This Hand Pump Milk Frother just keeps on going, as long and as far as you do. Works with Dairy, Nut, Rice and Soy Milks, Hot or Cold The versatile Bellemain whips any kind of milk: dairy or dairy free, full fat to fat free, preheated or not. If you like your froth piping hot, we suggest that you heat it when it's ready to go into your coffee, because it will cool a bit during the frothing process. Cold froths are perfect for cocktails that call for whipped cream. 14 Oz. Size for Family Use The froths about 3/4 cup (7 oz./205 ml.) of milk at a time, perfect for serving yourself or your family. Its total capacity is 14 oz., which allows for the fact that the milk will double in volume as it foams. How to use: Create thick, creamy froth for perfect cappuccinos, lattes or hot chocolate with this stainless steel milk frother.Simply add cold or warm milk, pump the knob up and down then pour. 1, 100% brand new and high quality. 2, Double mesh makes whipped milk easier and faster. 3, Made of Stainless steel,heat resistant handle, knob and lid grip 4, Push and Cream Barista Accessories Coffee Gadget Foam Maker Milk Creamer Kitchen Tool Fancy Coffee Machine Kitchen Decoration Perfect for Coffee shop, or as a Birthday Gift etc. 5, Kindly reminder: to avoid milk foam overflow out, pour 100-150ml milk would be best, keeping in mind the volume will increase 3-4x due to the frothing. Detail： Capacity:400mL Material:Stainless steel Package Included:1x Stainless Steel Milk Frother","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BUuPMoqSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Z/A","source_asin":"B08SGPX3RF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-124644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SGPX3RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SGPX3RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
