window.products.push({"id":124828,"name":"Mind Reader Egg Holder Refrigerator Storage Container, 12 Egg Tray, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.52,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gHNMRsfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep eggs organized and prevent broken eggs with the Mind Reader Egg Holder, Refrigerator Storage Container for Eggs with one dozen eggs capacity.FRIDGE ORGANIZERThe Mind Reader egg holder holds a dozen eggs and features a sturdy top cover so you can stack additional items on top to maximize storage space in your refrigerator.CLEAR STORAGE CONTAINER The transparent egg tray design allows for easy visibility. When running low on your eggs, you will be able to see exactly how many are left. Never run out of eggs again!SLIDING DRAWERThe egge holder has a drawer that slides in and out for easy access to the eggs. This space-saving design comfortably fits one dozen eggs.ALWAYS FRESH AND CLEANYou can re-use this organizer over and over again. The BPA-free plastic container helps to keep eggs fresh longer.FOOD SAFE AND BPA FREEThe container is made of durable, BPA-free material that is non-toxic and food safe.STACKABLE DESIGN MAXIMIZES SPACE IN YOUR REFRIDGERATORGet more than one egg storage drawer and stack them for added storage in your refrigerator. Safely store several dozen eggs in the stackable containers.PREMIUM EGG TRAYUse the egg holder tray to neatly organize your refrigerator and eliminate any loose eggs or flimsy egg cartons. The transparent lid protects eggs from cracking and provides visibility so you know when it's time to stock up again.REDUCE EGG BREAKAGEStore eggs in this organizer and reduce the risk of broken eggs in your refrigerator.EASY TO CLEANTo clean, simply hand wash with soapy water. The egg organizer is not dishwasher safe.Shop the Mind Reader egg tray and other high-quality items from the Mind Reader collection for storage and organizational solutions for the home, the office, and beyond.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gHNMRsfgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mind Reader","source_asin":"B076QPN519","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-124828","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076QPN519","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B076QPN519","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
