window.products.push({"id":124887,"name":"2 Packs of CAFEC 100-Pack Cone-shaped V60 02 Style Universal 2 to 4 Cup Disposable Pour-Over Drip Coffee Paper Filter made of Eco-Friendly Refined Vir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AYi8LqGkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FSC Certified: The FSC certificate shows that the banana-tree fiber to make the paper is only sourced from well-managed, eco-friendly forests. 100% sustainable: No wood is used in the papermaking process: ABACA: Manilla Hemp, is extracted from the leaf-stems of a certain species of banana tree, leaving the wood and tree completely intact. Papermaking process: Dewatering: Dewater pulp and make a paper sheet. Drying: Dry the paper sheet by heating. Rolling: Roll the paper sheet under finely tuned and adjusted rolling pressure. No bleach, glues, chemicals or unnatural elements are added to the pulp. This is simply a 100% clean, eco-friendly, forest-sustainable paper filter. Period. You will not be disappointed by the strength and suppleness of these high-quality crafted filters. They will certainly stand out above the rest and help you make the perfect cup of joe in the morning every time! If you love coffee and if making coffee is a labor of love, these filters - as well as the Sanyo Sangyo Porcelain flower-shaped Coffee Drippers - will enhance the quality of your morning coffeemaking routine! These coffeemaker paper filters are the best because: They are elegant, supple and strong. They make the cleanest, consistent coffee. They are made of superior eco-friendly certified materials. Clean-up is a cinch! When done, simply discard filter with used grounds inside. FSC Certified: The FSC certificate shows that the banana-tree fiber to make the paper is only sourced from well-managed, eco-friendly forests. 100% sustainable: No wood is used in the papermaking process: Papermaking process: Dewatering: Dewater pulp and make a paper sheet. Drying: Dry the paper sheet by heating. Rolling: Roll the paper sheet under finely tuned and adjusted rolling pressure. No bleach, glues, chemicals or unnatural elements are added to the pulp. This is simply a 100% clean, eco-friendly, forest-sustainable paper filter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AYi8LqGkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAFEC","source_asin":"B08L634V4B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-124887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L634V4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L634V4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":124888,"name":"Long Turn 90 Degree Dryer Elbow 4 Inch 10in Radius","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LubhD1OpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"90 Degree Long Turn Dryer Elbow - Overcomes Length of Run Issues and Increases Efficiency - 4\" x 10” radius. The Dryer-Ell has a long radius and smooth interior that reduces friction dramatically. This elbow will save the user 4.6 feet of duct run because this elbow, according to the building code and ASHREA calculations, has friction loss equal to straight pipe. The typical 3.5\" radius sectioned ell carries with it a run-length reduction penalty of 5 feet. Regarding efficiency, we estimate this ell pays for itself in 2 years. UL lab testing demonstrated this ell was 500% more efficient than the standard 4\" sectioned ell. Comes in two pieces and is assembled in the field with sheet metal screws (not included). Features a male and female end.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LubhD1OpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Dryer-Ell","source_asin":"B005FHXK2I","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-124888","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005FHXK2I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B005FHXK2I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
